      "effect_text": {
        "en": {
          "plain": "[Cast Cost] [Pay 1 life]\n[Cn/Turn] Choose one of the following.\n• Choose up to two monsters with [Transform], [Ride], or [Station] from your deck, put one card from among them into your hand, and drop the rest. Then, shuffle your deck.\n• Choose up to three <Hero World> monsters from your drop zone, and put them into the soul of a《Super Robot》or《Battleship》on your field. Then, put up to one card from the soul of a《Battleship》on your field into your hand.",
